<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S5.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Results on math benchmarks.<span id="S5.T1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We report Avg@16 accuracy with relative improvements shown as subscripts. Positive gains are shown in <span id="S5.T1.8.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">green</span> and negative changes in <span id="S5.T1.8.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span>. FlowRL outperforms all baselines across both 7B and 32B model scales.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S5.T2.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:276.0pt;height:74.7pt;vertical-align:-35.4pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-43.1pt,11.7pt) scale(0.762200375124851,0.762200375124851) ;">
