<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A3.T6.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Math reasoning performance (Avg@64) at temperature <math id="A3.T6.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=1.0</annotation></semantics></math>. Relative improvements are shown as subscripts, with positive gains in <span id="A3.T6.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#228B22;">green</span>. FlowRL maintains robust performance under higher generation randomness and continues to outperform all baselines on average.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
